  "ai_overview": {
    "text_blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Carefully read your denial letter and compare the reasons given against your specific policy terms to see if the rejection is valid.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "Carefully read your denial letter and compare the reasons given against your specific policy terms to see if the rejection is valid"
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Action Steps After a Denial"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Review the denial letter and policy: Find the exact clauses or exclusions (like normal wear and tear vs. storm damage) cited by your insurer."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Request your complete claim file: Ask for the adjuster\u2019s notes, measurement sheets, and original photos to check for mistakes or missed details."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Get an independent inspection: Hire a trusted, licensed local roofer to perform a detailed second assessment and document any overlooked damage with photos."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "File a formal appeal: Submit a written request for reconsideration to your insurance company backed by your new contractor's report, photos, and local weather data."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Bring in extra help if needed: Hire a public adjuster to advocate for you, invoke the appraisal clause in your policy, file a complaint with your state\u2019s insurance department, or consult an insurance attorney."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Avoid early permanent repairs: Do not fix the roof permanently before a reinspection, though you should tarp or cover exposed areas to prevent further damage."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you want, tell me:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "What reason did the insurance company give for the denial?"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "What type of weather event caused the damage (hail, wind, etc.)?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "I can give you more specific advice on how to build your appeal."
      }
    ],
